  "changes": [
    "Publish hydrated topology immediately; move existing automatic route calculation to a cancellable module worker with bounded progress, timeout and visible Retry.",
    "Add exact versioned route-cache validity across geometry, all obstacles, pins, connections, modes and bends; unchanged saved routes reuse their layout without launching a worker.",
    "Guard completion by job generation and authored node/wire references; cancel superseded or unmounted work and coalesce unfinished-load replacements after edits.",
    "Keep derived routing completion out of local dirty revisions, model rebuilds, undo history and collaboration echoes; preserve runtime node values.",
    "Carry optional cache metadata through save/load, share, collaboration and lab restoration; restore authored lab snapshots instead of runtime feedback.",
    "Keep routing status invalidation in the same local store publication to avoid adding extra publications to normal drag updates."
  ],
